/E (To validate the AI-assisted features, demonstrations will show users interacting with the operating system using both traditional shell commands and natural language requests. The system will also be tested using simulated error scenarios, such as invalid commands and kernel diagnostic logs, to verify that the AI assistant can analyze system information, provide meaningful explanations, and recommend appropriate recovery actions. Additional testing will include memory allocation, interrupt handling, shell command execution, logging functionality, and complete integration between the operating system, AI communication layer, and external AI service. Successful completion of these demonstrations, along with stable execution during continuous testing, will confirm that the system operates as intended.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [22]
>>
